{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30017_01_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a6db721359b6e164fe55c35964083c5a7c0fe837e087af688adccf05afb1c7c7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a0ba3f7ed14cf5e86149b302ba8b2a80d55fcf576bec1fbc6be09ff3bdded20",
      "text": "对啊！现在正是展现\n“合作游玩”的时候啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:033857e61af92b551be234de9d9601786b417643ded01f0654d185dd10467434",
      "text": "…嗯。大吾的背后还有我们在。\n一起以“SSS级”为目标吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7e8a471d364b7b86be8697fb61a41b26c73bcdf4f9e008b74e75e703a17d0d6",
      "text": "噢！只要俺们齐心协力，一定没问题的！\n老师，背后就交给你了……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb480817d850e52fff16c7f374293db132a014839a961a5a5aa63d4a0b00cf8f",
      "text": "……啊，分数出来了！结果是……\n太好啦——！居然是“SSS级”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77c264b2a45657e42d29b3cd4fd553d3fe06e733c92b50077c7046740ed42a76",
      "text": "…辛苦了，大吾。\n总算是达成目标了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7f4b2daaee79950e04097ab55bbf8afd8da1a70a6d8f4268efd74bf713db3c1",
      "text": "噢！老师，也谢谢你的配合！能拿到\n最高评级固然很高兴……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7832c4c34c2a90247a5866e7b36e1c17eaeda96b984d2772d86406b7e9fda1df",
      "text": "但最让人开心的，莫过于这是和大家\n齐心协力达成的结果了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000148:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42c4000af5d65c85f5dfbbe4e0e526a5b12f1ffe0af0faeaae20174bf0813333",
      "text": "真不愧是F-LAGS的各位呢。大家齐心协力克服\n难关的身姿……在旁边看着真的很令人感动！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:270956c000aee27e45af2c143736717987b394f5d059a94be00f9f726122ee56",
      "text": "是啊。拍到了非常棒的画面哦！\n这样一来，游玩画面的拍摄就完全搞定了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000171:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e",
      "text": "然后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000183:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee418ada39ca65c0241e60c91ad9ff447891b49c3661395a2f339fb012ca0f6f",
      "text": "这个游戏的魅力，就在于大人和孩子能一起乐在其中！\n请大家务必一起试玩看看哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000200:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71e9d98f15d61dfafa925f449d7abbad2f09d8fd965b446490e1922714c5a9e7",
      "text": "…收录的曲目也很丰富。如果选曲拿不定主意，\n请试着玩玩我们的歌曲吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000217:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcd9e028ab09f5f854d5c6dfd19039d12271a16e3855dfc9148cd52407abc5ab",
      "text": "还有……虽然一个人也能玩得很开心，\n但和同伴一起合作挑战高难度也很有趣哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000222:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aea986e6d49a237f4393fe51ac22aa5db237cda9801dcf1e9b62c8d02d8691b9",
      "text": "就算一个人跨不过去的困难，\n只要和同伴在一起就一定能战胜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000251:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1d735ab3cb489039507095aff600ca7ce71096d5e380ec6524e65ad53641760",
      "text": "就像俺们拿到最高评级一样！哇哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000267:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2a40248a047b34eca4002dcdf855823097e67ae97e2d83de4a83373b48f972a",
      "text": "几周后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000274:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18dd73c8ee57062955a72e43518e6b84231d805bffa16f08f632f8556af6ef2b",
      "text": "我刚才去了一趟\n游戏厅",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000276:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4394d7b148cab7bcf5a284fb5c39bf239ab5151bb9431fdb25e7e2bb0b7b7d22",
      "text": "俺们前阵子\n拍摄的PV，\n店里正在播呢<emoji>image_talk_emoji_35</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000278:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76d5632edf5acfed6290e8a25d9ef1d9f5a1704538ecb411ea8fb5915acd6b75",
      "text": "说起来那款音游，\n今天正式上线了呢<emoji>image_talk_emoji_16</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000280:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:856c219717fa7292b0a74b638a9396145181768e90dfc715e00f59fd93609560",
      "text": "是这样呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000280:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50f7b39f0b3ae6fb89783c74cfd37c0258e4fcdcec1e3790d9857e960b6c82ac",
      "text": "是这样呢！总觉得才刚拍完\n没多久，\n真是一转眼就到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000283:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:432d2948e1d6a83f33ec90d7d3700dc5964b278a59f68fd9a7ee6f1c3fd177e6",
      "text": "嗯。为了学习而前往游戏厅的事，\n感觉就像发生在昨天一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000285:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9e77a904de483ed2155fe121c565bd4cc4757b4d0178dc5908cf7ef38323d89",
      "text": "拍摄的时候也很开心呢。\n大家齐心协力\n以最高评级为目标……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000287:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:451a33f5884f534bd7f2bcc3f8eda6f79f0ca4b188304e97a101f9c93bb5c960",
      "text": "不知道为什么，像这样聊着聊着，\n又想和大家一起去游戏厅了啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000289:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b476584c2fb706e3295d97fca0f01c28c0656e1534f27f32583386034c5fe86d",
      "text": "啊，我也是！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000291:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b60f204ca764b62811747d5fc875e8f8a9fa50d2bdff351af7a542a716124f0",
      "text": "那就难得有机会！\n要是大家都有空，不如现在就\n一起去看看怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000293:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a52450d46575199cc37f87531014be4749c466ddc3491770b531a91958cf80bd",
      "text": "我也赞成。待会儿\n在游戏厅集合吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
